{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20779","headline":"扬州送伯龄过江 · 卢仝","name":"扬州送伯龄过江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伯龄不厌山，山不养伯龄。\n松颠有樵堕，石上无禾生。\n不忍六尺躯，遂作东南行。\n诸侯尽食肉，壮气吞八紘。\n不唧溜钝汉，何由通姓名。\n夷齐饿死日，武王称圣明。\n节义士枉死，何异鸿毛轻。\n努力事干谒，我心终不平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20779.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20779","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}